[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/188917449","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/188917449/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/188917449/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/encode/httpx/releases/tag/0.28.1","id":188917449,"author":{"login":"lovelydinosaur","id":647359,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzM1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/647359?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur","html_url":"https://github.com/lovelydinosaur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOCrLX_c4LQqbJ","tag_name":"0.28.1","target_commitish":"master","name":"Version 0.28.1","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2024-12-06T15:35:41Z","updated_at":"2024-12-06T15:36:24Z","published_at":"2024-12-06T15:36:24Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/tarball/0.28.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/zipball/0.28.1","body":"## 0.28.1 (6th December, 2024)\r\n\r\n* Fix SSL case where `verify=False` together with client side certificates.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/188917449/reactions","total_count":16,"+1":12,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/188051569","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/188051569/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/188051569/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/encode/httpx/releases/tag/0.28.0","id":188051569,"author":{"login":"lovelydinosaur","id":647359,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzM1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/647359?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur","html_url":"https://github.com/lovelydinosaur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOCrLX_c4LNXBx","tag_name":"0.28.0","target_commitish":"master","name":"Version 0.28.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2024-11-28T14:50:04Z","updated_at":"2025-01-16T16:29:00Z","published_at":"2024-11-28T14:53:50Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/tarball/0.28.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/zipball/0.28.0","body":"## 0.28.0 (28th November, 2024)\r\n\r\nThe 0.28 release includes a limited set of deprecations.\r\n\r\n**Deprecations**:\r\n\r\nWe are working towards a simplified SSL configuration API.\r\n\r\n*For users of the standard `verify=True` or `verify=False` cases, or `verify=<ssl_context>` case this should require no changes. The following cases have been deprecated...*\r\n\r\n* The `verify` argument as a string argument is now deprecated and will raise warnings.\r\n* The `cert` argument is now deprecated and will raise warnings.\r\n\r\nOur revised [SSL documentation](docs/advanced/ssl.md) covers how to implement the same behaviour with a more constrained API.\r\n\r\n**The following changes are also included**:\r\n\r\n* The deprecated `proxies` argument has now been removed.\r\n* The deprecated `app` argument has now been removed.\r\n* JSON request bodies use a compact representation. (#3363)\r\n* Review URL percent escape sets, based on WHATWG spec. (#3371, #3373)\r\n* Ensure `certifi` and `httpcore` are only imported if required. (#3377)\r\n* Treat `socks5h` as a valid proxy scheme. (#3178)\r\n* Cleanup `Request()` method signature in line with `client.request()` and `httpx.request()`. (#3378)\r\n* Bugfix: When passing `params={}`, always strictly update rather than merge with an existing querystring. (#3364)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/188051569/reactions","total_count":29,"+1":22,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":2,"eyes":2}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/172138427","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/172138427/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/172138427/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/encode/httpx/releases/tag/0.27.2","id":172138427,"author":{"login":"lovelydinosaur","id":647359,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzM1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/647359?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur","html_url":"https://github.com/lovelydinosaur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOCrLX_c4KQp-7","tag_name":"0.27.2","target_commitish":"master","name":"Version 0.27.2","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2024-08-27T12:52:05Z","updated_at":"2024-08-27T12:52:29Z","published_at":"2024-08-27T12:52:29Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/tarball/0.27.2","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/zipball/0.27.2","body":"## 0.27.2 (27th August, 2024)\r\n\r\n### Fixed\r\n\r\n* Reintroduced supposedly-private `URLTypes` shortcut. (#2673)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/172138427/reactions","total_count":17,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":6,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":5,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/171499522","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/171499522/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/171499522/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/encode/httpx/releases/tag/0.27.1","id":171499522,"author":{"login":"lovelydinosaur","id":647359,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzM1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/647359?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur","html_url":"https://github.com/lovelydinosaur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOCrLX_c4KOOAC","tag_name":"0.27.1","target_commitish":"master","name":"Version 0.27.1","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2024-08-27T11:27:08Z","updated_at":"2024-08-27T11:27:46Z","published_at":"2024-08-27T11:27:46Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/tarball/0.27.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/zipball/0.27.1","body":"## 0.27.1 (27th August, 2024)\r\n\r\n## Added\r\n\r\n* Support for `zstd` content decoding using the python `zstandard` package is added. Installable using `httpx[zstd]`. (#3139)\r\n\r\n### Fixed\r\n\r\n* Improved error messaging for `InvalidURL` exceptions. (#3250)\r\n* Fix `app` type signature in `ASGITransport`. (#3109)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/171499522/reactions","total_count":15,"+1":12,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":3,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/142968465","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/142968465/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/142968465/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/encode/httpx/releases/tag/0.27.0","id":142968465,"author":{"login":"lovelydinosaur","id":647359,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzM1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/647359?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur","html_url":"https://github.com/lovelydinosaur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOCrLX_c4IhYaR","tag_name":"0.27.0","target_commitish":"master","name":"Version 0.27.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2024-02-21T13:06:19Z","updated_at":"2024-02-21T13:06:50Z","published_at":"2024-02-21T13:06:50Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/tarball/0.27.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/zipball/0.27.0","body":"## 0.27.0 (21st February, 2024)\r\n\r\n### Deprecated\r\n\r\n* The `app=...` shortcut has been deprecated. Use the explicit style of `transport=httpx.WSGITransport()` or `transport=httpx.ASGITransport()` instead.\r\n### Fixed\r\n* Respect the `http1` argument while configuring proxy transports. (#3023)\r\n* Fix RFC 2069 mode digest authentication. (#3045)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/142968465/reactions","total_count":17,"+1":11,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":4,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/134415330","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/134415330/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/134415330/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/encode/httpx/releases/tag/0.26.0","id":134415330,"author":{"login":"karpetrosyan","id":92274156,"node_id":"U_kgDOBX_97A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92274156?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karpetrosyan","html_url":"https://github.com/karpetrosyan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karpetrosyan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karpetrosyan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karpetrosyan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karpetrosyan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karpetrosyan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karpetrosyan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karpetrosyan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karpetrosyan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karpetrosyan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOCrLX_c4IAwPi","tag_name":"0.26.0","target_commitish":"master","name":"Version 0.26.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2023-12-20T10:52:22Z","updated_at":"2023-12-20T11:01:16Z","published_at":"2023-12-20T11:01:16Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/tarball/0.26.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/zipball/0.26.0","body":"## 0.26.0 (20th December, 2023)\r\n\r\n### Added\r\n\r\n* The `proxy` argument was added. You should use the `proxy` argument instead of the deprecated `proxies`, or use `mounts=` for more complex configurations. (#2879)\r\n\r\n### Deprecated\r\n\r\n* The `proxies` argument is now deprecated. It will still continue to work, but it will be removed in the future. (#2879)\r\n\r\n### Fixed\r\n\r\n* Fix cases of double escaping of URL path components. Allow / as a safe character in the query portion. (#2990)\r\n* Handle `NO_PROXY` envvar cases when a fully qualified URL is supplied as the value. (#2741)\r\n* Allow URLs where username or password contains unescaped '@'. (#2986)\r\n* Ensure ASGI `raw_path` does not include URL query component. (#2999)\r\n* Ensure `Response.iter_text()` cannot yield empty strings. (#2998)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/134415330/reactions","total_count":15,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":7,"confused":0,"heart":7,"rocket":1,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/131230148","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/131230148/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/131230148/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/encode/httpx/releases/tag/0.25.2","id":131230148,"author":{"login":"karpetrosyan","id":92274156,"node_id":"U_kgDOBX_97A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92274156?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karpetrosyan","html_url":"https://github.com/karpetrosyan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karpetrosyan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karpetrosyan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karpetrosyan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karpetrosyan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karpetrosyan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karpetrosyan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karpetrosyan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karpetrosyan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karpetrosyan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOCrLX_c4H0mnE","tag_name":"0.25.2","target_commitish":"master","name":"Version 0.25.2","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2023-11-24T12:33:18Z","updated_at":"2023-11-24T12:35:20Z","published_at":"2023-11-24T12:34:49Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/tarball/0.25.2","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/zipball/0.25.2","body":"## 0.25.2 (24th November, 2023)\r\n\r\n### Added\r\n\r\n* Add missing type hints to few `__init__()` methods. (#2938)\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/131230148/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/127872550","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/127872550/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/127872550/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/encode/httpx/releases/tag/0.25.1","id":127872550,"author":{"login":"lovelydinosaur","id":647359,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzM1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/647359?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur","html_url":"https://github.com/lovelydinosaur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOCrLX_c4Hny4m","tag_name":"0.25.1","target_commitish":"master","name":"Version 0.25.1","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2023-11-03T13:18:54Z","updated_at":"2023-11-03T13:25:25Z","published_at":"2023-11-03T13:25:25Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/tarball/0.25.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/zipball/0.25.1","body":"## 0.25.1 (3rd November, 2023)\r\n\r\n* Add support for Python 3.12. (#2854)\r\n* Add support for httpcore 1.0 (#2885)\r\n\r\n### Fixed\r\n\r\n* Raise `ValueError` on `Response.encoding` being set after `Response.text` has been accessed. (#2852)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/127872550/reactions","total_count":19,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":12,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":4,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/120613802","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/120613802/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/120613802/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/encode/httpx/releases/tag/0.25.0","id":120613802,"author":{"login":"lovelydinosaur","id":647359,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzM1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/647359?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur","html_url":"https://github.com/lovelydinosaur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOCrLX_c4HMGuq","tag_name":"0.25.0","target_commitish":"master","name":"Version 0.25.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2023-09-11T10:13:24Z","updated_at":"2023-09-11T10:14:00Z","published_at":"2023-09-11T10:14:00Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/tarball/0.25.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/zipball/0.25.0","body":"## 0.25.0 (11th Sep, 2023)\r\n\r\n### Removed\r\n\r\n* Drop support for Python 3.7. (#2813)\r\n\r\n### Added\r\n\r\n* Support HTTPS proxies. (#2845)\r\n* Change the type of `Extensions` from `Mapping[Str, Any]` to `MutableMapping[Str, Any]`. (#2803)\r\n* Add `socket_options` argument to `httpx.HTTPTransport` and `httpx.AsyncHTTPTransport` classes. (#2716)\r\n* The `Response.raise_for_status()` method now returns the response instance. For example: `data = httpx.get('...').raise_for_status().json()`. (#2776)\r\n\r\n### Fixed\r\n\r\n* Return `500` error response instead of exceptions when `raise_app_exceptions=False` is set on `ASGITransport`. (#2669)\r\n* Ensure all `WSGITransport` environs have a `SERVER_PROTOCOL`. (#2708)\r\n* Always encode forward slashes as `%2F` in query parameters (#2723)\r\n* Use Mozilla documentation instead of `httpstatuses.com` for HTTP error reference (#2768)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/120613802/reactions","total_count":26,"+1":11,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":11,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":2,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/103443407","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/103443407/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/103443407/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/encode/httpx/releases/tag/0.24.1","id":103443407,"author":{"login":"lovelydinosaur","id":647359,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzM1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/647359?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur","html_url":"https://github.com/lovelydinosaur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOCrLX_c4GKmvP","tag_name":"0.24.1","target_commitish":"master","name":"Version 0.24.1","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2023-05-18T11:03:21Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:05:02Z","published_at":"2023-05-18T11:05:02Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/tarball/0.24.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/zipball/0.24.1","body":"## 0.24.1 (17th May, 2023)\r\n\r\n### Added\r\n\r\n* Provide additional context in some `InvalidURL` exceptions. (#2675)\r\n\r\n### Fixed\r\n\r\n* Fix optional percent-encoding behaviour. (#2671)\r\n* More robust checking for opening upload files in binary mode. (#2630)\r\n* Properly support IP addresses in `NO_PROXY` environment variable. (#2659)\r\n* Set default file for `NetRCAuth()` to `None` to use the stdlib default. (#2667)\r\n* Set logging request lines to INFO level for async requests, in line with sync requests. (#2656)\r\n* Fix which gen-delims need to be escaped for path/query/fragment components in URL. (#2701)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/103443407/reactions","total_count":29,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":3,"hooray":9,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":6,"eyes":1}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/98894390","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/98894390/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/98894390/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/encode/httpx/releases/tag/0.24.0","id":98894390,"author":{"login":"lovelydinosaur","id":647359,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzM1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/647359?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur","html_url":"https://github.com/lovelydinosaur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOCrLX_c4F5QI2","tag_name":"0.24.0","target_commitish":"master","name":"Version 0.24.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2023-04-11T10:00:02Z","updated_at":"2023-04-11T10:00:19Z","published_at":"2023-04-11T10:00:19Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/tarball/0.24.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/zipball/0.24.0","body":"## 0.24.0 (6th April, 2023)\r\n\r\n### Changed\r\n\r\n* The logging behaviour has been change to be more in-line with other standard Python logging usages. We no longer have a custom `TRACE` log level, and we no longer use the `HTTPX_LOG_LEVEL` environment variable to auto-configure logging. We now have a significant amount of `DEBUG` logging available at the network level. Full documentation is available at https://www.python-httpx.org/logging/ (#2547, encode/httpcore#648)\r\n* The `Response.iter_lines()` method now matches the stdlib behaviour and does not include the newline characters. It also resolves a performance issue. (#2423)\r\n* Query parameter encoding switches from using + for spaces and %2F for forward slash, to instead using %20 for spaces and treating forward slash as a safe, unescaped character. This differs from `requests`, but is in line with browser behavior in Chrome, Safari, and Firefox. Both options are RFC valid. (#2543)\r\n* NetRC authentication is no longer automatically handled, but is instead supported by an explicit `httpx.NetRCAuth()` authentication class. See the documentation at https://www.python-httpx.org/advanced/#netrc-support (#2525)\r\n\r\n### Removed\r\n\r\n* The `rfc3986` dependancy has been removed. (#2252)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/98894390/reactions","total_count":43,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":2,"hooray":28,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":3,"eyes":1}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/87864417","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/87864417/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/87864417/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/encode/httpx/releases/tag/0.23.3","id":87864417,"author":{"login":"lovelydinosaur","id":647359,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzM1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/647359?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur","html_url":"https://github.com/lovelydinosaur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOCrLX_c4FPLRh","tag_name":"0.23.3","target_commitish":"master","name":"Version 0.23.3","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2023-01-04T09:39:43Z","updated_at":"2023-01-04T09:39:59Z","published_at":"2023-01-04T09:39:59Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/tarball/0.23.3","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/zipball/0.23.3","body":"## 0.23.3 (4th Jan, 2023)\r\n\r\n### Fixed\r\n\r\n* Version 0.23.2 accidentally included stricter type checking on query parameters. This shouldn've have been included in a minor version bump, and is now reverted. (#2523, #2539)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/87864417/reactions","total_count":25,"+1":10,"-1":0,"laugh":2,"hooray":5,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":4,"eyes":1}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/87691040","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/87691040/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/87691040/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/encode/httpx/releases/tag/0.23.2","id":87691040,"author":{"login":"lovelydinosaur","id":647359,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzM1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/647359?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur","html_url":"https://github.com/lovelydinosaur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOCrLX_c4FOg8g","tag_name":"0.23.2","target_commitish":"master","name":"Version 0.23.2","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2023-01-02T11:46:22Z","updated_at":"2023-01-02T11:47:10Z","published_at":"2023-01-02T11:47:10Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/tarball/0.23.2","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/zipball/0.23.2","body":"## 0.23.2 (2nd Jan, 2023)\r\n\r\n ### Added\r\n\r\n * Support digest auth nonce counting to avoid multiple auth requests. (#2463)\r\n\r\n ### Fixed\r\n\r\n * Multipart file uploads where the file length cannot be determine now use chunked transfer encoding, rather than loading the entire file into memory in order to determine the `Content-Length`. (#2382)\r\n * Raise `TypeError` if content is passed a dict-instance. (#2495)\r\n * Partially revert the API breaking change in 0.23.1, which removed `RawURL`. We continue to expose a `url.raw` property which is now a plain named-tuple. This API is still expected to be deprecated, but we will do so with a major version bump. (#2481)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/87691040/reactions","total_count":26,"+1":11,"-1":0,"laugh":2,"hooray":4,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":5,"eyes":1}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/83535508","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/83535508/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/83535508/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/encode/httpx/releases/tag/0.23.1","id":83535508,"author":{"login":"lovelydinosaur","id":647359,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzM1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/647359?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur","html_url":"https://github.com/lovelydinosaur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOCrLX_c4E-qaU","tag_name":"0.23.1","target_commitish":"master","name":"Version 0.23.1","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2022-11-18T12:48:32Z","updated_at":"2022-11-18T12:49:26Z","published_at":"2022-11-18T12:49:26Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/tarball/0.23.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/zipball/0.23.1","body":"## 0.23.1\r\n\r\n### Added\r\n\r\n* Support for Python 3.11. (#2420)\r\n* Allow setting an explicit multipart boundary in `Content-Type` header. (#2278)\r\n* Allow `tuple` or `list` for multipart values, not just `list`. (#2355)\r\n* Allow `str` content for multipart upload files. (#2400)\r\n* Support connection upgrades. See https://www.encode.io/httpcore/extensions/#upgrade-requests\r\n\r\n### Fixed\r\n\r\n* Don't drop empty query parameters. (#2354)\r\n\r\n### Removed\r\n\r\n* Drop `.read`/`.aread` from SyncByteStream/AsyncByteStream (#2407)\r\n* Drop `RawURL`. (#2241)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/83535508/reactions","total_count":36,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":1,"hooray":21,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":4,"eyes":2}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/67557349","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/67557349/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/67557349/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/encode/httpx/releases/tag/0.23.0","id":67557349,"author":{"login":"lovelydinosaur","id":647359,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzM1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/647359?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur","html_url":"https://github.com/lovelydinosaur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOCrLX_c4EBtfl","tag_name":"0.23.0","target_commitish":"master","name":"Version 0.23.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2022-05-23T15:31:12Z","updated_at":"2022-05-23T15:31:24Z","published_at":"2022-05-23T15:31:24Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/tarball/0.23.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/zipball/0.23.0","body":"## 0.23.0 (23rd May, 2022)\r\n\r\n ### Changed\r\n\r\n * Drop support for Python 3.6. (#2097)\r\n * Use `utf-8` as the default character set, instead of falling back to `charset-normalizer` for auto-detection. To enable automatic character set detection, see [the documentation](https://www.python-httpx.org/advanced/#character-set-encodings-and-auto-detection). (#2165)\r\n\r\n ### Fixed\r\n\r\n * Fix `URL.copy_with` for some oddly formed URL cases. (#2185)\r\n * Digest authentication should use case-insensitive comparison for determining which algorithm is being used. (#2204)\r\n * Fix console markup escaping in command line client. (#1866)\r\n * When files are used in multipart upload, ensure we always seek to the start of the file. (#2065)\r\n * Ensure that `iter_bytes` never yields zero-length chunks. (#2068)\r\n * Preserve `Authorization` header for redirects that are to the same origin, but are an `http`-to-`https` upgrade. (#2074)\r\n * When responses have binary output, don't print the output to the console in the command line client. Use output like `<16086 bytes of binary data>` instead. (#2076)\r\n * Fix display of `--proxies` argument in the command line client help. (#2125)\r\n * Close responses when task cancellations occur during stream reading. (#2156)\r\n * Fix type error on accessing `.request` on `HTTPError` exceptions. (#2158)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/67557349/reactions","total_count":42,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":18,"confused":0,"heart":4,"rocket":12,"eyes":1}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/58014137","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/58014137/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/58014137/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/encode/httpx/releases/tag/0.22.0","id":58014137,"author":{"login":"lovelydinosaur","id":647359,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzM1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/647359?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur","html_url":"https://github.com/lovelydinosaur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOCrLX_c4DdTm5","tag_name":"0.22.0","target_commitish":"master","name":"Version 0.22.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2022-01-26T14:47:40Z","updated_at":"2022-01-26T14:47:57Z","published_at":"2022-01-26T14:47:57Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/tarball/0.22.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/zipball/0.22.0","body":"## 0.22.0 (26th January, 2022)\r\n\r\n### Added\r\n\r\n* Support for [the SOCKS5 proxy protocol](https://www.python-httpx.org/advanced/#socks) via [the `socksio` package](https://github.com/sethmlarson/socksio). (#2034)\r\n* Support for custom headers in multipart/form-data requests (#1936)\r\n\r\n### Fixed\r\n\r\n* Don't perform unreliable close/warning on `__del__` with unclosed clients. (#2026)\r\n* Fix `Headers.update(...)` to correctly handle repeated headers (#2038)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/58014137/reactions","total_count":20,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":16,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/56541369","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/56541369/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/releases/56541369/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/encode/httpx/releases/tag/0.21.3","id":56541369,"author":{"login":"lovelydinosaur","id":647359,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzM1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/647359?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur","html_url":"https://github.com/lovelydinosaur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovelydinosaur/orgs","rep